shortdesc Helper commands and element definitions for Docutils LaTeX output
longdesc The package is intended for use with LaTeX documents generated
longdesc from reStructuredText sources with Docutils. When generating
longdesc LaTeX documents, specify this package with the stylesheet
longdesc configuration option, e.g. rst2latex --stylesheet=docutils
